<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= typeof lang !== 'undefined' && lang ? lang : 'id' %>">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cetak Batch Invoice Tagihan - Periode <%= month %>/<%= year %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 12mm 15mm;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1e293b;
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .no-print-bar {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #4338ca; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border-color: #cbd5e1; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #e2e8f0; }

    .invoice-page {
      page-break-after: always;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .invoice-page:last-child {
      page-break-after: auto;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .invoice-card {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 35px 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      position: relative;
    }

    .invoice-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #6366f1;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .company-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .company-logo {
      max-height: 65px;
      max-width: 180px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .company-details h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .company-details p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .invoice-meta {
      text-align: right;
    }
    .invoice-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #4f46e5;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .invoice-number {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .status-paid { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; border: 1px solid #86efac; }
    .status-unpaid { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; }

    .details-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    }
    .details-block h3 {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .details-block .name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .details-block div {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .table-container {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    table.invoice-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    table.invoice-table th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #475569;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    }
    table.invoice-table td {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
    }
    table.invoice-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
    }

    .summary-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .notes-box {
      max-width: 50%;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border-left: 3px solid #6366f1;
    }
    .totals-box {
      width: 260px;
    }
    .totals-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .totals-row.grand-total {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-top: 2px solid #0f172a;
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .signature-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }
    .signature-box {
      text-align: center;
      width: 200px;
    }
    .signature-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .signature-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      padding-top: 4px;
    }

    .invoice-footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 15px;
      border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        background: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
      }
      .no-print-bar {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .invoice-page {
        margin-bottom: 0 !important;
      }
      .invoice-card {
        box-shadow: none !important;
        border: none !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        max-width: 100% !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="no-print-bar">
    <div>
      <strong>Cetak Batch Invoice Tagihan Periode <%= month %>/<%= year %></strong>
      <span style="margin-left: 10px; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px;">(Total <%= invoicesData ? invoicesData.length : 0 %> tagihan)</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.print()"><i class="bi bi-printer"></i> Cetak Semua (<%= invoicesData ? invoicesData.length : 0 %>)</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="window.close()"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i> Tutup</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%
    const monthNamesIndo = ['Januari','Februari','Maret','April','Mei','Juni','Juli','Agustus','September','Oktober','November','Desember'];
    const monthNamesEn = ['January','February','March','April','May','June','July','August','September','October','November','December'];
    const isEn = (typeof lang !== 'undefined' && lang === 'en');
    const mns = isEn ? monthNamesEn : monthNamesIndo;
    const logoUrl = (settings && settings.company_logo) ? settings.company_logo : '/img/logo.png';
  %>

  <% if (invoicesData && invoicesData.length > 0) { %>
    <% invoicesData.forEach(function(item) {
        const invoice = item.invoice;
        const customer = item.customer || {};
        const isPaid = String(invoice.status || '').toLowerCase() === 'paid';
    %>
      <div class="invoice-page">
        <div class="invoice-card">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="invoice-header">
            <div class="company-brand">
              <img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="Logo" class="company-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
              <div class="company-details">
                <h1><%= company %></h1>
                <p><%= settings.company_address || 'Pusat Layanan Internet & Ekosistem Digital' %></p>
                <p>Telp/WA: <%= (settings.whatsapp_admin_numbers && settings.whatsapp_admin_numbers.length > 0) ? '+' + settings.whatsapp_admin_numbers[0] : (settings.company_phone || '-') %></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="invoice-meta">
              <div class="invoice-title">INVOICE</div>
              <div class="invoice-number">#INV-<%= invoice.id %>-<%= invoice.period_year %></div>
              <span class="status-badge <%= isPaid ? 'status-paid' : 'status-unpaid' %>">
                <%= isPaid ? (isEn ? 'PAID' : 'LUNAS') : (isEn ? 'UNPAID' : 'BELUM BAYAR') %>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Details Grid -->
          <div class="details-grid">
            <div class="details-block">
              <h3>Ditagihkan Kepada:</h3>
              <div class="name"><%= customer.name || 'Pelanggan' %></div>
              <div>ID Pelanggan: <strong>MDE-<%= String(customer.id || 0).padStart(4, '0') %></strong></div>
              <div>Alamat: <%= customer.address || '-' %></div>
              <div>Telepon/WA: <%= customer.phone || '-' %></div>
            </div>
            <div class="details-block">
              <h3>Informasi Tagihan:</h3>
              <div>Periode: <strong><%= mns[invoice.period_month - 1] %> <%= invoice.period_year %></strong></div>
              <div>Tanggal Tagihan: <%= invoice.created_at ? (typeof formatDateLocal === 'function' ? formatDateLocal(invoice.created_at) : invoice.created_at) : '-' %></div>
              <div>Status Pembayaran: <strong><%= isPaid ? 'LUNAS' : 'BELUM BAYAR' %></strong></div>
              <% if (isPaid) { %>
                <div>Tanggal Bayar: <%= invoice.paid_at ? (typeof formatDateLocal === 'function' ? formatDateLocal(invoice.paid_at) : invoice.paid_at) : '-' %></div>
                <div>Metode / Kasir: <%= invoice.paid_by_name || 'Sistem' %></div>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Table -->
          <div class="table-container">
            <table class="invoice-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th style="width: 40px; text-align: center;">#</th>
                  <th>Deskripsi Layanan</th>
                  <th>Periode</th>
                  <th style="text-align: right;">Jumlah (Rp)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td style="text-align: center;">1</td>
                  <td>
                    <strong><%= customer.package_name || 'Paket Internet' %></strong>
                    <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">Langganan Akses Internet Kecepatan Tinggi</div>
                  </td>
                  <td><%= mns[invoice.period_month - 1] %> <%= invoice.period_year %></td>
                  <td style="text-align: right; font-weight: 700;">Rp <%= Number(invoice.amount || 0).toLocaleString('id-ID') %></td>
                </tr>
                <% if (invoice.carried_balance && Number(invoice.carried_balance) > 0) { %>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="text-align: center;">2</td>
                    <td>Tunggakan / Saldo Bawaan Periode Sebelumnya</td>
                    <td>-</td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;">Rp <%= Number(invoice.carried_balance).toLocaleString('id-ID') %></td>
                  </tr>
                <% } %>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <!-- Summary & Totals -->
          <div class="summary-section">
            <div class="notes-box">
              <strong>Catatan:</strong>
              <p><%= invoice.notes || 'Terima kasih atas kepercayaan Anda menggunakan layanan kami. Mohon simpan invoice ini sebagai bukti pembayaran resmi.' %></p>
            </div>
            <div class="totals-box">
              <div class="totals-row">
                <span>Subtotal</span>
                <span>Rp <%= Number(invoice.amount || 0).toLocaleString('id-ID') %></span>
              </div>
              <div class="totals-row grand-total">
                <span>Total Bayar</span>
                <span>Rp <%= Number(invoice.amount || 0).toLocaleString('id-ID') %></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Signatures -->
          <div class="signature-section">
            <div class="signature-box">
              <div class="signature-title">Pelanggan</div>
              <div class="signature-name"><%= customer.name || 'Pelanggan' %></div>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-box">
              <div class="signature-title">Hormat Kami (Manajer / Kasir)</div>
              <div class="signature-name"><%= settings.company_manager || 'Admin Billing' %></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <div class="invoice-footer">
            Bukti Pembayaran Resmi - <%= company %> | Dicetak Otomatis dari Sistem Billing
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% }) %>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="invoice-card" style="text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px;">
      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle" style="font-size: 48px; color: #94a3b8;"></i>
      <h3 style="margin-top: 15px; color: #334155;">Tidak Ada Tagihan Ditemukan</h3>
      <p style="color: #64748b;">Tidak ada tagihan yang cocok untuk periode <%= month %>/<%= year %>.</p>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <script>
    window.onload = function() {
      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      if (urlParams.get('autoprint') !== '0') {
        setTimeout(() => { window.print(); }, 500);
      }
    };
  </script>
</body>
</html>
